      "content": "That makes sense, but some economists say that the \"capital flight\" argument is basically an outdated scare tactic used to protect the ultra-wealthy. If we look at the actual data from countries that have tried similar things, wouldn't the long-term benefits of social stability and public investment outweigh the risk of a few people moving their money?",
